TITLE Pure water equilibrated with CH4-CO2-NH3 gas at 150C, fixed pressure
SOLUTION 1
    temp 150
    pH 7 charge
    pe 4
    units mol/kgw
    -water 1
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 1
    -temperature 150
    CH4(g)  0.0  10
    CO2(g)  0.0  10
    NH3(g)  0.0  5
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.txt
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -pH true
    -pe true
    -ionic_strength true
USER_PUNCH
    -headings Specific_conductance_uS_per_cm
    10 PUNCH SC
END
